  "full_text": "So, uh, um, what you don't want to be is like a transvestite. That's like a fucked up person that's kind of like, okay, that's kind of bad. What that means is, uh, like trying to be other than who you are. I don't know how to explain it. I am not real sure how this works, but you have to take things in moderation. So you can't just like all of a sudden be something else. You got to take things in moderation. There's plenty of things that I do that are fucked. Diet soda. I'm fucked. So, I don't even know how bad it's going to be. But anyway, so like, you got to stop trying to scheme. Stop scheming. Stop scheming. You know, because shit's going to happen. If someone robs you of something, maybe it was hurting you. You know, if you get a disease, maybe it was something you didn't want. Like I had some, maybe I had some plastic surgery. Like my bone was kind of, my jaw was kind of upset a little bit. It hurt. It was like out of joint and stuff. And anyway, so like plastic surgery kind of from God, you know. Like anyway, so like, so like I think you need the concept of like blinders. You know what I'm saying? It's like sometimes you just got to like stop scheming and just say, you know. Fuck it, I'm just going to act natural. Then your head will clear and you'll start to get out of a haze. Boy, I was in a fucked up haze. My God, I was in a fucking... I was in a fucked up... I was like, my brain was all fucking twisted to knots, you know? Schizophrenic, obviously, yeah. Anyway.",
